tips.suggestion:
[重构思路] 删除死分支，改为显式捕获 KeeperException 并按错误类型区分：可恢复的硬件/超时错误按“未获取到 bucket”返回 nullptr，其余仍抛业务异常。代码示例：
```cpp
try
{
    code = zk_client->tryMulti(requests, responses);
}
catch (const Coordination::Exception & e)
{
    if (Coordination::isHardwareError(e.code))
        return nullptr;
    throw;
}
```
